    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is \u201cDot Piece Puzzle\u201d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the simple puzzle game what uses dot-art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player fits the Dot-Piece that come apart, after the model Dot-Picture as a guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play &quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle game in which the player fits the scattered dot pieces together, using the model dot picture as a guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play 59 puzzles what different dot-picture patterns based on the themes, &quot;Animals&quot; and &quot;Foods&quot; and the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you start to play easy puzzle and try difficult a little bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During from easy to difficult, you can play more than 290+ ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Kurayami&quot; mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kurayami&quot; mode (exclusive to the Steam version) for experienced players, where you must solve puzzles without any reference image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And &quot;Kaiten&quot; mode tests your skills by requiring you to rotate the pieces before placing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive gameplay that's perfect for players of all ages and skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are challenging but not too difficult, providing a sense of accomplishment when they are solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot; can translate 17 languages; Japanese, English(US), Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, German, French, Italian, Spanish(Espa\u00f1ol), Arabic, Hindi, Bengali, Tamil, Indonesian, Russian, Portuguese(Brasil), and Polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose the language of the puzzle names and the messages from the options, if you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comment from the Creator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created &quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot; because we wanted to play a puzzle game where we could create pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the feeling of the pieces fitting together and the sense of accomplishment when we solve a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy playing &quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot; as much as we enjoyed creating it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is \u201cDot Piece Puzzle\u201d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the simple puzzle game what uses dot-art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player fits the Dot-Piece that come apart, after the model Dot-Picture as a guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play &quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle game in which the player fits the scattered dot pieces together, using the model dot picture as a guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play 59 puzzles what different dot-picture patterns based on the themes, &quot;Animals&quot; and &quot;Foods&quot; and the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you start to play easy puzzle and try difficult a little bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During from easy to difficult, you can play more than 290+ ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Kurayami&quot; mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kurayami&quot; mode (exclusive to the Steam version) for experienced players, where you must solve puzzles without any reference image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And &quot;Kaiten&quot; mode tests your skills by requiring you to rotate the pieces before placing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive gameplay that's perfect for players of all ages and skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are challenging but not too difficult, providing a sense of accomplishment when they are solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot; can translate 17 languages; Japanese, English(US), Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, German, French, Italian, Spanish(Espa\u00f1ol), Arabic, Hindi, Bengali, Tamil, Indonesian, Russian, Portuguese(Brasil), and Polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose the language of the puzzle names and the messages from the options, if you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comment from the Creator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created &quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot; because we wanted to play a puzzle game where we could create pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the feeling of the pieces fitting together and the sense of accomplishment when we solve a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy playing &quot;Dot Piece Puzzle&quot; as much as we enjoyed creating it!</p>",
